adow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/blog/best-animal-names-by-color/\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">🎨</div><span class=\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">Naming Tips</span><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\">Best Animal Names by Color: 200+ Ideas for Every Shade 🎨</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\">Find the perfect name based on your pet&#x27;s color! From snow-white names to midnight-black names, explore 200+ color-inspired animal names organized by every shade of the rainbow.</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/blog/best-animal-names-inspired-by-mythology/\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">⚡</div><span class=\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">Naming Tips</span><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\">Best Animal Names Inspired by Mythology: Gods, Heroes &amp; Legends ⚡</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\">Name your pet after the gods, heroes, and mythical creatures of world mythology. From Greek and Norse to Egyptian and Japanese legends, find powerful, meaningful names.</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/blog/animal-names-that-mean-strength/\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">💪</div><span class=\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">Naming Tips</span><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\">Animal Names That Mean Strength: Powerful Names for Mighty Pets 💪</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\">Give your pet a name that embodies power, courage, and resilience. Discover 150+ animal names that mean strength from languages and cultures around the world.</p></a></div></section><nav class=\"mt-12 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\" aria-label=\"Post navigation\"><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group text-left\" href=\"/blog/animal-names-that-mean-strength/\"><span class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">← Previous Post</span><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary mt-1 line-clamp-1\">Animal Names That Mean Strength: Powerful Names for Mighty Pets 💪</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group text-right\" href=\"/blog/best-animal-names-for-aquatic-pets/\"><span class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">Next Post →</span><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary mt-1 line-clamp-1\">Best Animal Names for Aquatic Pets: Fish, Turtles &amp; More 🐠</p></a></nav><div class=\"mt-12 p-6 bg-primary/5 rounded-2xl border border-primary/10 text-center\"><p class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2\">🐾 Ready to find the perfect animal name?</p><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4\">Browse our complete collection of 200+ animal name generators — all 100% free.</p><a class=\"inline-block bg-primary text-white font-bold px-6 py-3 rounded-full hover:bg-primary-dark transition-colors\" href=\"/animals/\">Browse All Animals →</a></div></article><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"bg-gray-900 text-gray-400 py-10\" aria-label=\"Site footer\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-8\"><div><h4 class=\"text-white font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-3\">Company</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm\"><li><a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/about/\">About</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/editorial-policy/\">Editorial Policy</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-whi